  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Larry Folding</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5752 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-news category-zoom tag-larry-folding tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5752\">\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-demo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding Demo</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-dfd2582e14930d4b2c34/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Video</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-01T07:57:38-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, May 1, 2021, 7:57 am\">May 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5734\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6b9a0f8c5f6130988f7ec84e1e2c687ecfcbed898826363f24ba86889e0585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Larry Folding gave a tour of his Harwich studio and a 1/2 hour watercolor demonstration at the April 24th General Meeting. View the meeting here using the access passcode <b>LarryFolding@421<br />\n</b></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Meeting Recording:<b><br />\n<a href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/share/MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJasLnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/<wbr></wbr>share/<wbr></wbr>MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-<wbr></wbr>1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJas<wbr></wbr>LnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca</a></b></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4202 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-free-demonstration tag-harwich-community-center tag-larry-folding tag-watercolor-artist\" id=\"post-4202\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"804\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a house on a hill.\" src=\"/media/archive/379ba606fbdae582f87cf1d59d143bd811645428266aa47993e8f308d9a11916.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding – Watercolor Painting Demonstration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-04-13T15:41:11-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 13, 2019, 3:41 pm\">April 13, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists Meeting – Saturday, April 20, 2:00-4:00 pm Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich 02645 Free and Open to the Public – Refreshments will be served. <a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4037 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-brian-powers tag-cape-cod-art-center tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-martha-little-fuentes\" id=\"post-4037\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"All new england 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The All New England Opens at the Cape Cod Art Center</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T16:18:08-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 4:18 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Cape Cod Art Center, Barnstable Mass announced acceptance of artists in their Annual Juried Show, “The All New England” Guild members whose work will be exhibited: Anne Briggs, Larry <a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3724 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-harwich-ma tag-larry-folding tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-watercolor\" id=\"post-3724\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/watercolor-classes-with-larry-folding-begin-may-1/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Watercolor Classes with Larry Folding Begin May 1</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-25T00:41:10-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 25, 2018, 12:41 am\">April 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists member, Larry Folding will hold Watercolor Classes at the Harwich Cultural Center Tuesdays beginning May 1st thru June 19th from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM. Classes <a href=\"/news/watercolor-classes-with-larry-folding-begin-may-1/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-artweek tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-kathleen-magnusson tag-larry-folding tag-lydia-bell tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yvette-stenzel\" id=\"post-3684\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman painting with watercolors at a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/00421df83ff95b315a4308f2588b50a921d82bd450400bc624f11b2de9128f5b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-03T01:06:43-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 3, 2018, 1:06 am\">April 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>April Meetings: Executive Board Meeting:  Monday, April 9, 2018, 9:30a.m. at Harwich Chamber of Commerce Board Room, 1 Schoolhouse Road, Harwich Port Gallery Meeting:  Saturday, April 21, 2018, 12:30 p.m <a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3631 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3631\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Season Kicks Off Early for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-25T13:32:43-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, March 25, 2018, 1:32 pm\">March 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Special for ArtWeek, two demonstrations will kick off  the 2018 season at The Gallery of Harwich Artists. Larry Folding will demonstrate a Cape Cod painting in watercolor on April 28 <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-season-kicks-off-early-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav cl